 - Active Tool\n\n\nOwner\nakanespsTV\n\nCo-Owner\niPerzt, GM2\n\nDevelopers\nButedMesa: Sound Designer\nl2sb: Builder\nkkontrast: Scripter\nvalorantjuy: Modeler\nghjmyuymtutrmy : VFX,Modeler\n\n\nSpecial Thanks To\nDrCamper: Clothing Assets\nTarvero: Thumbnail, etc\nFantichz\nnichekino\n\n","path":"/game/17126500142-abyss-miner","slug":"17126500142-abyss-miner","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/704e910e3a6f8ab6ba55a3302c530eb33702a7e57db2fd3a2c26e707f8f47243.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-16cffca57c7669d0ed2abd57962c3dc7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":6291708,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-27T12:07:57.882Z","creator":{"name":"The Abyss Dwellers","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":75203399886990,"name":"Mafia Clash","desc":"🔪Your family is at WAR! Four rival families are competing for control of your city's underworld. Whose side will you take? Will you be a simple grunt, rise through the ranks to become the boss, or fight them as a cop? 🔪\n\n⭐ CLAIM your COMMUNITY MEMBER role by joining the group: https://www.roblox.com/groups/35589408\n\n- 💰 Become the Boss and command real players to glory!\n- 🧑‍🏭 Climb the ranks of your family with over 11 unique classes!\n- ❤️ Steal and survive in a massive open world! \n- 👍 Enjoy the game? Leave a favorite and like to support the developers!\n\n💬Check out the Social Links below to learn more about our community!\n\n🏷️1930’s, Tommy gun, Shooter, Jail, Cops, Police, Heist, Robbery","path":"/game/75203399886990-mafia-clash","slug":"75203399886990-mafia-clash","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d22ea00c833fe400cb3a0d380594937da94ad56bf7e10680e3368a9f5845ea23.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-30db657ecd7c7d218401566ebdf154a5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":8,"visitor":3032303,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-02T13:18:18.263Z","creator":{"name":"Mafia Clash Community","type":"Group"},"script":{